      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "44",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilizwi elafika kuJeremiya ngabo bonke abaJuda ababehlala elizweni laseGibithe eMigidoli laseTahafanesi, laseMemfisi, laselizweni lasePatrosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lathi: INkosi yamabandla, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, ithi: Likubonile konke okubi engakwehlisela phezu kweJerusalema laphezu kwayo yonke imizi yakoJuda. Lamhla iyinkangala, kakulamuntu ohlala khona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngenxa yobubi babo ababenzayo, bangivusa ulaka ngoba batshisa impepha, bakhonza abanye onkulunkulu abangabaziyo bona kanye lani labokhokho benu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanti ngathuma inceku zami zonke abaprofethi, ngazithuma njalonjalo, ngisithi: Lingayenzi linto enengisayo lengiyizondayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kabalalelanga kabezwanga, ukuba baphenduke ebubini babo, bangatshiseli abanye onkulunkulu impepha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho ulaka lwami lokuthukuthela kwami kwavutha emizini yonke yakoJuda lasezindleleni zeJerusalema; zaphenduka zaba yinkangala, zachitheka njengalamhla nje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke iNkosi, uNkulunkulu wamabandla, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, ithi: Likwenzelani phezu kwenu lokhu okubi kangaka, ukuba libhubhise indoda lomfazi, usane lomntwana, baphele koJuda, kungasali muntu na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kungani lingithukuthelisa ngezithombe zenu, litshisela abanye onkulunkulu impepha eGibithe lapho selihlala khona, ukuze libhujiswe, liphenduke into yokuthukwa leyokuhlekwa phakathi kwazo zonke izizwe zasemhlabeni na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Selakhohlwa yini ububi babokhokho benu, lobubi bamakhosi akoJuda, lobubi babomkabo, lobenu ububi, lobubi babomkenu, elabenza elizweni lakoJuda lasezindleleni zeJerusalema na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalizithobanga kuze kube lamhla, futhi kalesabanga, kalihambanga ngomlayo wami langezimiso zami engazibeka phambi kwenu laphambi kwabokhokho benu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke iNkosi yamabandla, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, ithi: Ngizalenzela okubi ukuba ngiliqede elizweni lonke lakoJuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizathatha abaseleyo koJuda abafise ukuzahlala eGibithe, bazabhubha bonke, babulawe yimpi layindlala elizweni laseGibithe, baphele bonke abancinyane labakhulu, babe yinto eyenyanyekayo, into eyesabekayo, leyokuthukwa, leyokuhlekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizatshaya labo abahlezi eGibithe, njengoba ngatshaya iJerusalema, ngempi langendlala langomkhuhlane, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuze kungabi khona loyedwa kwabaseleyo koJuda, abafikileyo ukuhlala eGibithe, ozaphunyuka asile, abuyele elizweni lakoJuda abafisa ukubuyela kulo, bahlale khona; ngoba kabayikubuyela kuphela abaphunyukileyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonke amadoda ayesazi ukuthi omkabo batshisela abanye onkulunkulu impepha, labo bonke abesifazana ababekhona belixuku elikhulu, labo bonke abantu ababehlala ePatrosi elizweni laseGibithe, bamphendula uJeremiya bathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilizwi olikhulume kithi ebizweni leNkosi kasiyikulilalela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa sizakwenza konke esizimisele ukukwenza; sizatshisela iNkosikazi yaphezulu impepha, siyithululele iminikelo yokuthululwa, njengokuba besisenza thina, labobaba, lamakhosi ethu, lezikhulu zethu, emizini yakoJuda lasezindleleni zeJerusalema; ngoba sasilokudla okunengi, sihlezi kuhle singaboni okubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa lokhu sayekela ukutshisela iNkosikazi yaphezulu impepha lokuyithululela iminikelo yokuthululwa, siswele konke, siqedwe yimpi layindlala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abesifazana bona bathi: Lapho sasitshisela iNkosikazi yaphezulu impepha, siyithululela iminikelo yokuthululwa, kumbe siyenzela izinkwa ezilomfanekiso wayo, siyithululela iminikelo yokuthululwa, sakwenza lokho ngaphandle kwemvumo yabomkethu na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJeremiya wasesithi kubo bonke abantu, amadoda labesifazana, bonke ababemphendule ngalowomazwi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Impepha elayitshisa emizini yakoJuda lasezindleleni zeJerusalema, lina laboyihlo, lamakhosi enu, lezikhulu zenu, labantu belizwe, iNkosi kayikukhumbulanga na? Kakungenanga engqondweni yayo na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yayingaselakukuthwala okubi kwemisebenzi yenu lezinengiso elazenzayo; ngakhoke ilizwe lenu lachitheka, laba yinkangala, laba yinto yokuthukwa, kakusekho okuhlala khona njengoba kunjalo lamhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kungenxa yokuba litshisile impepha, lona eNkosini, lingalilalelanga ilizwi layo, lingahambanga ngomlayo wayo langezimiso zayo langemithetho yayo, ngalokho okubi lokhu kwehlele phezu kwenu njengalamhla nje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJeremiya wathi kubo bonke abantu lakwabesifazana bonke: Zwanini ilizwi leNkosi, lina lonke bakoJuda eliselizweni laseGibithe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yamabandla, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, ithi: Lina labomkenu likukhulumile ngemilomo yenu, lakugcwalisa ngezandla zenu, lathi: Sizagcwalisa impela izifungo zethu esizenzileyo zokuba sitshisele iNkosikazi yaphezulu impepha, siyithululele iminikelo yokuthululwa. Ngakho qinisani izifungo zenu, lizenze! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa zwanini ilizwi leNkosi, lina lonke bakoJuda elihlala eGibithe: Khangelani, ngifungile ibizo lami elikhulu, kutsho iNkosi, ukuba ibizo lami kalisayikubizwa futhi ngumlomo womuntu koJuda, kulo lonke ilizwe laseGibithe, ngokuthi: Ngifunga iNkosi uNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngilindele ukubenza okubi, kungesikho okuhle; bonke abakoJuda abaseGibithe bazaqedwa yimpi layindlala, baze baphele bonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labo abaphepha empini bazabuyela elizweni lakoJuda bevela eGibithe, beyingcosana nje; labo bonke abaseleyo koJuda abeze eGibithe ukuhlala khona, bazakwazi ukuba ilizwi elizakuma ngelikabani, elami kumbe elabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
